  "task": "As the infrastructure manager for the Lakeside District, I've received reports of recurring water quality issues and deteriorating park infrastructure. I need to verify the current water system status and urban ecology metrics, then address any critical failures. If problems are confirmed, I must initiate immediate containment measures and public alerts, followed by environmental compensation actions."
